{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "c3c11e49cbe0ffcf87f88d40f3882aa28e7a363264f0eb94ca1ed9977124169f", "ja": "休息Chu→FEELING", "zh": "休息Chu→FEELING", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2e9b565c65982c80f08c3e4d702875d665458fd562c0ec652dcafb08044c6cfa", "ja": "もらった休みに、杏奈の家でお泊まり会をす\nることに。やりたかったネットゲームを楽し\nみながら、杏奈は百合子が初めてできた大切\nな友達だと語る。絆を深めることで、公演へ\nの気力を取り戻すふたり。", "zh": "两人拿到休假后，决定在杏奈家里过夜。\n她们享受之前一直想玩的线上游戏，同时杏奈\n表示，百合子是她第一个交到的重要朋友。\n两人的情谊变得更加深厚，令她们找回了\n准备公演的精力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_05_1000_se", "source_sha256": "d7f0742f486712cf4a0ae941f2940c5ff5b706f1e8901b366c57f247e3b3cc81", "ja": "ガチャッ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_05_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "b0c3b48f54b5859e9c0992491eb1f2f47ee553077196b5d2e98a99819508573c", "ja": "どうぞ、百合子さん……。\n入って……。", "zh": "来，百合子……\n请进……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_05_1002_026yur", "source_sha256": "508711c466d89915b7c79c4def000b9a5ffca3caa3149f9825c4622f813afe66", "ja": "うん、お邪魔します。\nわぁ、ここが杏奈ちゃんのお部屋かぁ……！", "zh": "嗯，打扰了。\n哇，这里就是小杏的房间啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_05_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "ed16bef7439d68cbbf79a5d7f6510cf5a8d63cdac1521ae9d70934aa20ec9b18", "ja": "あ、お泊まりさせてもらうんだから、ご挨拶しなきゃ。\nあれ、お母さんは？", "zh": "啊，得先打个招呼，告知今天要过夜才行。\n咦，你妈妈不在吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_05_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "ae0b1d9c4bf889cf6c6ae15efb6d0f96a36ebf71799ef6ff545d659d15249467", "ja": "ん……まだ、帰ってない……。\nうち、共働きで……ふたりとも、遅いから……。", "zh": "嗯……她还没回来……\n我们家是，双薪家庭……所以他们都，很晚回来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_05_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "d054b57d5527d46a079242371be8b62a6d01fe94e0275d542c1abf07e1a5b143", "ja": "そうなんだ……じゃあ後でだね。", "zh": "原来是这样……那就等一下再说吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_05_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "eaf6065372d805065f66b05daa79c642b120144bc80e85746dab3041c3904aa5", "ja": "百合子さん、シフォンケーキ……食べる？\n杏奈……お仕事で、覚えたから……。", "zh": "百合子，你要吃……戚风蛋糕吗？\n杏奈在……之前在工作中，学到了作法……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_05_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "5f399fa9b95a28b3fd7095824f32017d6ab266665110755fd87c1c82ee78861e", "ja": "えっ、いいの？　食べる食べる！\nわぁ、楽しみだなぁ～♪", "zh": "咦，可以吗？我要吃我要吃！\n哇，好期待喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_05_1008_null", "source_sha256": "e62e007ef70868efbfce4142775d6da2f531e9562abcc3cf181147ddaaa68213", "ja": "―3時間後―", "zh": "─三小时后─", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_05_1009_se", "source_sha256": "20b1e6715a1c181b8cf6068b95c216684b7b994717fe193d6d4b09a83b773fe4", "ja": "カチャカチャカチャ……（×2）", "zh": "喀答喀答喀答……（x2）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_05_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "fb9253cc88a528ef12b5ef277468f2440770d937959aba41d0520f263a104d2a", "ja": "長かった戦いもこれで終わり……！\n勇者vivid_rabbit、今こそあなたの力を見せて！", "zh": "漫长的战斗即将在这里划下句点……！\n勇者vivid_rabbit，现在正是展现你力量的时候！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_05_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "b80ba734fb8367882a5b1e7dfb5280914b3e616668307ddc2bbf2ed8e0a02cfc", "ja": "きったよ～っ♪　ここでvivid_rabbitが\n究極進化！　ダメ押しのパワーア～ップっ！", "zh": "来了～♪vivid_rabbit就在这一刻究极进化！\n提升威力使出最后一击～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_05_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "fbd4e8d82ef82fb44c6641544e745f0f672c4e50370e6024087de1eab5203168", "ja": "lilyknightのアシストがあれば、\nvivid_rabbitはいつだって無敵になれるっ♪", "zh": "只要有lilyknight的协助，\nvivid_rabbit无论何时都会是无敌的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_05_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "fa972e237343e01e140ecdce759417338910294d0894ae508990831f0353f938", "ja": "ふたりの力がひとつになれば、\n世界だって変えられる……♪", "zh": "只要结合两个人的力量，\n连世界都能改变……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_05_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "b912d58b1d2cd5a4cab5b7b1a21303aa5caf70c9d22f9624c45194a4608eecdb", "ja": "ラビットハート・アクセラレーション・アタック！！", "zh": "兔兔之心加速攻击！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_05_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "b912d58b1d2cd5a4cab5b7b1a21303aa5caf70c9d22f9624c45194a4608eecdb", "ja": "ラビットハート・アクセラレーション・アタック！！", "zh": "兔兔之心加速攻击！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_05_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "54e82d811e22ee54bf5da6883abe00cae68f0451ff0b64ec1b673debc94d8df8", "ja": "雷鳴竜サンダードラゴン、イベント中に倒すのは\nもう無理だと思ってたけど……やったね、杏奈ちゃん！", "zh": "我还以为已经不可能在活动中打倒\n雷鸣龙Thunder Dragon了……真是太好了，小杏！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_05_1017_024ann", "source_sha256": "66a085decf6a5b34681f2fd2a889de682b9141aad263dcb108818b01e870653d", "ja": "ん……。\n百合子さんとクリアできて、うれしい……です♪", "zh": "嗯……\n能够跟百合子一起通关，杏奈很高兴……喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_05_1018_024ann", "source_sha256": "156a7c5ba36d3da87af9e1aba565c1033ab4e2f741072df25bf2d0df8dd6e31e", "ja": "あ、雷鳴竜のウロコ……\nドロップ、してる。", "zh": "啊，是雷鸣龙的鳞片……\n打到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_05_1019_026yur", "source_sha256": "1fb9ca11dd1df950fc410813a5a9b5acaff9ff63665c34fbf564fc02ba93afb2", "ja": "わあ、すごいよ杏奈ちゃん！　それって、\nスターライトイヤリングの材料だよね！？", "zh": "哇啊，太厉害了，小杏！\n那是星光耳环的材料对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_05_1020_024ann", "source_sha256": "37172bc3a2b1bc874bf2717d3bd08b86f16e7d0077f0b317846ac81a3e6df299", "ja": "クリティカル2倍の……最強装備……。\n百合子さんに、あげる。", "zh": "爆击两倍的……最强装备……\n百合子，给你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_05_1021_026yur", "source_sha256": "a15a6fec30e21dac17c8ee24736ed3b73c586232d9983bd2bd175eab6d5758c1", "ja": "えっ？　そんな、もらえないよ！　私、ほとんど勝手に\nダメージ受けて、勝手に回復してただけなのに。", "zh": "咦？怎么可以，我不能收下啦！\n我刚刚几乎都是自己挨打，然后又自己回复而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_05_1022_024ann", "source_sha256": "f5b49350949b25de1d40bd1f5ebe57fab3b36dee36ee2c2f24094fed364e3da6", "ja": "でも、百合子さんと一緒に、倒したから……。\nそれに……lilyknightに、似合いそう♪", "zh": "可是，杏奈是跟百合子一起打倒牠的……\n而且……耳环感觉很适合lilyknight喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_05_1023_026yur", "source_sha256": "909b26eab6af5d15c3f4bbcd047aa0bf9b9e39474704cb610a9079691fe0a36b", "ja": "杏奈ちゃん……。", "zh": "小杏……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_05_1024_026yur", "source_sha256": "af18bcaa93d5c08ab9de2673c4f5115f0f0b90dc55968abbe682b7ad925e0215", "ja": "じゃあ……、今日はお泊まりだから、時間あるし。\nレアドロするまで、ボス戦回そっか♪", "zh": "那就……反正今天要过夜，时间还很多。\n我们就刷Boss战刷到掉宝吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_05_1025_024ann", "source_sha256": "23f4154a5bb93b8ab47352448976231d8ea34ff785ce30ceb72e255ad227dda5", "ja": "……うん♪　んと……百合子さん……。\nありがと……です。", "zh": "……嗯♪那个……百合子……\n谢谢……你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_05_1026_026yur", "source_sha256": "4cb0cb845f9c066f59b363d347e03b88f1f911e0a1d956fbacf3fba54882b89a", "ja": "え？　……どうしたの、杏奈ちゃん？", "zh": "咦……谢我什么呢，小杏？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_05_1027_024ann", "source_sha256": "405bcc8055f318a9feedc29d41ed93a74f3daf8c5c53c2a2c932dbf010fc0ac9", "ja": "杏奈……。\nこんなにずっと、友達と遊んだの……初めて……。", "zh": "杏奈……\n还是第一次像这样……长时间，跟朋友一起玩……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_05_1028_024ann", "source_sha256": "b366eca776b0b64a8f6ebcac2bee83ed6a68b0ba61ca74da29fe6b2777aefdaa", "ja": "杏奈、転校ばっかりして……\n友達、全然、できなかった……から……。", "zh": "因为，杏奈才刚转学过来……\n都交不到……朋友……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_05_1029_026yur", "source_sha256": "5410c4be71ad83fc1fc15e08833665f6119dcd599197efc0fa592ae92470c565", "ja": "杏奈ちゃん……。\nそうだったんだ……。", "zh": "小杏……\n原来是这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_05_1030_026yur", "source_sha256": "3484b9b46dbc732a3b2cfbf9369f5323f437bfc33fd3e485535522768722bd3d", "ja": "あのね、私もなの！　こんな風に、友達のおうちに\nお泊まりして、ゲームで遊ぶのなんて初めてで……。", "zh": "跟你说，我也一样喔！像这样到朋友家里过夜，\n一起打电玩之类的，我也是第一次……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_05_1031_026yur", "source_sha256": "3bb53627028539f26ab69b8a0131ee667a3932569c9ac73cfb250fbdac930daf", "ja": "えへへ、初めて同士だね、私たち。\n遊ぶことも……お仕事のことも。", "zh": "嘿嘿，我们都是第一次呢。\n不管是游玩……还是在工作上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_05_1032_026yur", "source_sha256": "a90b278c65272ed97a252450a4074a2b062541c669ddf887adcb2b11f5e5b2f6", "ja": "私ね、杏奈ちゃんと、もっといろんなことがしたい。\nゲームも、リーダーのお仕事も……ちゃんとしたい。", "zh": "我啊，还想跟小杏一起做更多各种不同的事。\n不管是电玩还是队长的工作……我都想跟你一起做好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_05_1033_024ann", "source_sha256": "b22b8321f2f8054f4ef0ae4289900b81cafedde2bdcf604313c3c3fc1713893a", "ja": "うん……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_05_1034_026yur", "source_sha256": "106ab2263b02724d74d13bec6fa57abbfcee5b165fe5485e577b84388afdd830", "ja": "泣いちゃったりもしたけど、杏奈ちゃんと\n公演の準備するの、すっごく楽しかったんだ。", "zh": "虽然之前还哭了，\n但是跟小杏一起准备公演时，我真的很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_05_1035_026yur", "source_sha256": "a3a8288234404769052bcc0602e3129736a803233f901ebf97324bc02c8ef965", "ja": "杏奈ちゃん。リーダーに誘ってくれて、ありがとう。\n……ひどいこと言って、ごめんなさいっ。", "zh": "小杏，谢谢你邀请我当队长。\n……对不起，之前对你说了很过分的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_05_1036_024ann", "source_sha256": "145c4fb4405925d13f2248392732885a2f48bcef9897988c817d06f61b9109a8", "ja": "ううん……。\n一緒に、リーダーしてくれて……ありがとう、です。", "zh": "不会……\n谢谢你……愿意跟我一起，担任队长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_05_1037_024ann", "source_sha256": "6d1c7af59d075869d13debf1910391954c90ecf91484580e46b10b067922f931", "ja": "今度の公演も、その後も、ずっと……。\nよろしくお願い、します♪", "zh": "这次的公演，还有往后……\n都要请你多多指教了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
